WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:36.850
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.420
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:33.270
Reset the world?

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:36.030
Rebuild it from zero?

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:39.920
Amelda, you're complaining like a loser.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:42.370
I will seize my own future!

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:45.780
It's meaningless if someone else creates the future!

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.520
Watch how the chosen one shines!

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:53.700
No one can block my road!

00:01:55.030 --> 00:02:01.030
Dartz's Shadow Approaches

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:12.810
Kaiba Corporation was taken over?

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:16.870
That's not possible.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:22.000
My big brother and I own more than 50% of Kaiba Corporation's shares.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.910
You need our approval.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.240
There's only one way I can think of.

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:28.530
They control the global market.

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:30.600
The global market?

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.030
Doma can do that?

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:36.640
I've underestimated their power.

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:37.720
Master Seto...

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:40.270
Don't call me that.  I'm no longer president.

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:42.010
Big brother...

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.040
No, Master Seto!

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:47.540
Until Kaiba Corporation is back in your hands...

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.410
We'll stay with you, Master Seto!

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:51.020
Isono!  Fuguta!

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:53.620
I appreciate the thought.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:57.860
Kaiba, let's hurry to the Florida museum.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:01.090
They must be there by now.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:04.600
Then we'll lose another lead!

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.600
We still have a chance.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:15.970
Who are you?

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:21.980
What's going on?

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:23.500
Hurry!

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:30.650
President, emergency call!

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:37.530
President!

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:41.270
I'm sending the image files of the undersea ruins!

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:43.100
Undersea ruins?

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:46.000
You already sent your men to the museum, Kaiba?

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:51.740
Of course.  My brother always thinks ten, twenty steps ahead!

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.140
Master Seto!

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.620
Kaiba...

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.620
We have the info we need.

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:14.030
The ruins' data...

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:16.770
Let's meet up, Otogi and Rebecca.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:20.500
Rebecca...

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:24.740
Rebecca, forgive the other Yugi.

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:28.250
Despite feeling sad, everyone is fighting.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:34.250
And I want to learn the truth of what I saw.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.490
Grandpa...

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:41.050
Yugi, the image files are no good as is.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:43.480
Most of the letters are faded.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:47.360
We need to restore them using an image processing computer.

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:51.370
Let's go to Kaiba Corporation's U.S. headquarters.

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:52.870
Seriously, Kaiba?

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:55.970
But hasn't Doma taken over already?

00:04:56.180 --> 00:05:01.980
Kaiba Corporation's computer is the fastest way to process a large amount of data.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:03.200
But-

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.200
Kaiba is right.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.100
Yugi?

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:10.490
They've taken Industrial Illusions, and now Kaiba Corporation.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:14.780
They control all the Duel Monsters in the world.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:16.730
We can't waste time.

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:22.230
Heh.  And I thought you'd be depressed over losing the Duel King title.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:27.640
Kaiba, I promised to do everything I can to defeat Doma.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:31.610
No matter what I must face, I'll get my partner's soul back!

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:37.850
I'll accept those words only after you restore honor to the Duel King name.

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:40.850
Yugi, you're back to your old self.

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:43.590
Professor, let's meet at the pier.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:46.090
Okay!  I'm steppin' on the gas!

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:57.100
An aurora?  Just like before?

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:18.950
After 10,000 years, it's almost time to draw out the full strength of my god.

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:23.930
Before then, I must collect sacrificial souls to resurrect my god.

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:29.930
Master Dartz.

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:37.970
Amelda...

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:39.570
Don't worry.

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:44.980
Amelda will nourish our god to help create a new world.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:51.790
The Nameless Pharaoh will be here soon.

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.200
Nameless Pharaoh?

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:56.790
I'll end him this time!

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:17.050
The time is coming.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:37.230
Our god's fragments scattered around the world!

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:57.790
Gain new life as god's disciples!

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:23.780
See ya!

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:24.820
Bye!

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:33.090
What's this pretty stone?

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:17.870
I must prepare to welcome the chosen duelists.

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:46.080
Hey!  Over here!

00:09:58.220 --> 00:10:00.910
Take them to the hospital.

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:02.980
Yes, sir!

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:07.780
Amelda...

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:09.650
Ryuzaki...

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:16.160
Rebecca.  Professor.

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:19.160
Otogi, thanks for bringing them here.

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:22.780
No problem.  Though we did run into some issues.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:23.670
What issues?

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:26.460
We met Mai on the way here.

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.670
She was with Valon from Doma.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:30.170
Valon?

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:32.740
He promised to defeat you.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:35.180
He was a terrifying duelist.

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:36.680
Damn!

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:38.410
Bring it on!

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.150
The other Yugi...

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:46.340
I can't forgive you yet.

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:48.790
Not until you get my darling back.

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:52.160
I promise to get my partner back.

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:58.530
Kaiba and I will head to Kaiba Corporation.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:02.270
I'll help!  Let me support you from the outside!

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:06.090
A kid like you is the U.S. champ?

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:08.010
Don't get in our way.

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:09.240
How dare you!

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:10.640
Let's go, Yugi.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:12.350
Big brother!

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:14.280
Don't worry, Mokuba.

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:16.290
It's our castle.

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.590
I won't give it up so easily.

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:23.440
Yugi, be careful.

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:24.280
Right.

00:11:25.690 --> 00:11:29.560
Anzu, let's go to the police.

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:32.200
There may be updates.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:33.700
Right.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:40.440
Where are we going, Kaiba?

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:46.450
This underground passage is Kaiba Corporation's shelter during emergencies.

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:57.880
We can get into the building without going through the main entrance.

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.110
Just watch, Doma.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:05.440
I won't let you do whatever you want.

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:14.420
What was that?

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:15.910
Something's there!

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:23.880
It's not Solid Vision!

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:38.400
Kaiba!  Let's summon our Duel Monsters!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:45.120
After my duel against Amelda, I knew their monsters didn't use my company's systems.

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:47.170
But our monsters are...

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:52.020
Kaiba, you need to believe that Duel Monsters are real.

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:56.180
But science hasn't advanced enough to prove it yet.

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:58.660
If you think like that, things aren't weird.

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:02.660
That's a silly theory, but let's test it.

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:04.260
Here we go, Kaiba!

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.560
Through the middle!

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:28.980
Doma?

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:30.570
It's true!

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:34.990
Doma is behind the Duel Monsters incidents all over the world!

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.990
Maybe you were dreaming.

00:13:37.990 --> 00:13:42.000
Believe us!  They're trying to destroy the world!

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:43.260
Really?

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:49.010
Did those Doma guys have this symbol?

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:52.010
You're...  Run, Anzu!

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:57.460
What?

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:00.380
A monster?

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:03.120
The one that attacked Yugi in the Rock Wasteland!

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.400
Anzu!  This way!

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:18.330
Go, Obnoxious Celtic Guard!

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:20.540
Vorse Raider!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.080
Now!  Let's go!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:37.620
No way!  They rewrote the security code!

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:47.490
This is bad!  We don't have a way out!

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:54.230
I'm here to help!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:04.050
Wasn't I helpful, President Kaiba?

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:04.980
Rebecca!

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:20.280
Kaiba Corporation's security is easy to break.

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:23.430
I have no clue what you're doing.

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:28.430
So that's the code.

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:31.440
President, you should hire me.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:34.170
I'll build a better security program.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:36.180
I'll think about it.

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:37.620
Let's go, Yugi.

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:47.620
Security is the only part I can manipulate from the outside.

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:50.590
The system's circuits are isolated, so I can't access it.

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:52.090
It's enough!

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:10.080
Retina matched.  Seto Kaiba confirmed.

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.360
Start voice recognition!

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:15.820
Cancel the current system and switch to the subsystem!

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:17.310
Understood.

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:23.860
Begin analyzing the ruins' data!

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:35.870
Grandpa!

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:43.880
"When the black serpent swallows the sun, a new paradise will resurrect after 10,000 years."

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:46.880
A serpent swallows the sun?

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:49.710
Paradise from 10,000 years ago...

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:52.510
The legendary paradise, Atlantis!

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:54.510
What?  No way!

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:58.060
This crest is Paradius Company's logo!

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:59.340
Paradius?

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:06.370
It's a super conglomerate that has several percent of every market in the world.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:10.740
They have the power to influence the presidents of major nations.

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:13.870
And their leader is...

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:19.850
Dartz!

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:21.640
He's...

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:35.530
He looks like him.

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.800
No, he is him.

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:39.370
But how?

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.770
The memory I saw was from 10,000 years ago.

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:50.370
Yugi!  President!

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:53.710
Rebecca, where's Paradius?

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.490
Accessing the map.

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:56.950
There it is!

00:17:57.990 --> 00:17:59.440
So that's Doma's HQ!

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:00.780
What are you doing?

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:02.530
I'll end this!

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:04.960
And save Mai and Ryuzaki!

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:18.300
Nameless Pharaoh and Seto Kaiba.

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:20.620
You've finally reached me.

00:18:21.430 --> 00:18:23.490
So you're Doma's mastermind.

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:28.400
Yes.  My name is Dartz.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:33.490
The world will soon be renewed under Doma's ideology.

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:36.000
The world's destruction is your ideology?

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:39.260
There's no justice in mass killing!

00:18:39.370 --> 00:18:41.590
What's your goal?

00:18:42.110 --> 00:18:43.500
My goal?

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:48.830
Nameless Pharaoh, I'm only obeying my destiny.

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:52.900
Destiny?  You're trying to decide the fate of the world!

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:59.930
You don't understand anything, Nameless Pharaoh and Seto Kaiba.

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:04.370
Your existence guided me to this future.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:06.010
Our existence?

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:07.350
What do you mean?

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:09.500
You don't need to know.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:13.090
Because you'll perish soon.

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:16.090
Dartz!  Fight me here!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:20.160
Release my partner and everyone else's souls!

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:35.840
The legendary dragons.

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:37.680
Long time, no see.

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:40.620
Does your eye still ache, Timaeus?

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:49.360
An illusion!

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:53.840
Once destiny starts moving, it can't be changed.

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:57.600
You'll learn how powerless you are.

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:59.240
Wait, Dartz!

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:03.980
Dartz!

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.070
Get in, Yugi!

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:26.220
Yugi!  Jump backwards!

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:27.200
What?

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:32.500
Kaiba!

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:53.360
No one's taking Kaiba Corporation from me!

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:54.610
What's that?

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:12.840
They're coming this way.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.730
Get Amelda's revenge, Valon.

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:19.240
Sorry, but I'm fighting for myself.

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:19.850
Valon!

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:28.090
Let's end this, Jonouchi.

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:33.480
Jonouchi!

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:36.260
Hey!  Where's that idiot going?

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:38.490
That's where the monsters are!

00:21:38.490 --> 00:21:40.010
Anzu, you go home!

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:41.810
Honda!

00:21:44.890 --> 00:21:47.850
Doma!  I'll end this!

00:21:57.440 --> 00:22:06.350
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:14.760
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:16.420 --> 00:22:25.850
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:26.460 --> 00:22:35.370
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:35.940 --> 00:22:44.400
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:45.180 --> 00:22:49.910
I'll live feeling them

00:22:50.520 --> 00:22:55.090
For me to be me

00:22:55.090 --> 00:23:03.550
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:09.190
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:09.710 --> 00:23:18.920
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:28.120
Doma is too big!

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:32.120
How can we fight them when they can even influence nations?

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:35.200
Jonouchi is heading to Doma's HQ alone.

00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:38.090
That's where the monsters who attacked Yugi are!

00:23:38.090 --> 00:23:42.000
But monsters weren't the only ones waiting for Jonouchi.

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:44.860
Valon wants a final fight, and Mai is after them.

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:46.800
What's going to happen?

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:50.370
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Clash!  Jonouchi vs Valon

00:23:50.370 --> 00:23:52.080
Duel, standby!
